  "thread_ts": "1770945821.640039",
  "text": "Done, counted the way your note says. Sheet (shared with you and Blake): https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1yySiISNHR8vC5IB-De4HbzPqLu1Ic9QY6AWTeZzB-D4/edit\n\n**Cost to build (Deel + studios/freelancers):**\n• Domino Delights: $951,817.64 (~$952K)\n• ZM: $544,433.44 (~$544K)\n• Combo Fighter: $72,685.61 (~$73K)\n\n**Brought in (lifetime revenue from REVENUE_DAILY, as recorded):**\n• Domino Delights: $12,331.25\n• ZM: $11.99\n• Combo Fighter: left off for now, until we check its first sales\n\n**What changes on the draft deck:**\n• \"What each bet cost to build\": DD $985K → **$952K**, ZM $609K → **$544K**, CF $74K → **$73K**\n• \"What each brought in\": fill in as DD **$12.3K**, ZM **$12**. Leave CF off.\n\nWhy the build numbers came down from your quick pass (which was all USD notices by date):\n• Marketing is now kept out of build: Node Media $16.4K (DD); Adjoe $46.2K, AppLovin $6.1K, PlayableX $3.75K, Telegram UA $1.5K (ZM/CF). It's still listed under its bet on the sheet.\n• Company items moved to the Company column ($49,625): Singular, TYZ, trademarks, JP's website, the 4X proposal. Martin's laptop is in there too, as BGN 1,999 in its own currency.\n• The $4,000 to JPMorgan is our own Chase account (Blake's email), so it's zero.\n• The Apr 2024 MotMot wire to ***8605 ($4,032) came back, so it's out.\n• Oleg's $125 came back too, and no Payoneer receipt reached my mail, so it's zero.\n• Leapblock closed its file and reported 407,944 over 30 wires. That beats the notices and adds the 13 Sep 2023 wire ($33,290) to DD.\n\nAll 22 Payee history issues are now Done. The four that don't match the notices (Leapblock, MotMot, JPMorgan, Oleg) have a comment explaining why."
 }
]
